a-col-size="sm">600–650 kg/m³</td></tr><tr data-start="5568" data-end="5612"><td data-start="5568" data-end="5584" data-col-size="sm">Particle Size</td><td data-start="5584" data-end="5612" data-col-size="sm">≥90% through 1.55–1.7 mm</td></tr><tr data-start="5613" data-end="5670"><td data-start="5613" data-end="5626" data-col-size="sm">Appearance</td><td data-start="5626" data-end="5670" data-col-size="sm">Light brown/yellowish powder or granules</td></tr><tr data-start="5671" data-end="5712"><td data-start="5671" data-end="5683" data-col-size="sm">Packaging</td><td data-start="5683" data-end="5712" data-col-size="sm">25 kg drums or jumbo bags</td></tr><tr data-start="5713" data-end="5748"><td data-start="5713" data-end="5726" data-col-size="sm">Shelf Life</td><td data-start="5726" data-end="5748" data-col-size="sm">24 months unopened</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></section><section class="related-products" style="margin-top:3rem;"><h2 style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">Related Products</h2><div class="related-products-grid" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2rem;"><p style="color:#666;">No related products found.</p></div></section><section class="product-reviews" style="margin-top:3rem;"><div id="comments" class="comments-area"><div id="respond" class="comment-respond"><h3 id="reply-title" class="comment-reply-title">Leave a Reply <small><a rel="nofollow" id="cancel-comment-reply-link" href="/product/l-lysine-sulphate-70-feed-grade/#respond" style="display:none;">Cancel reply</a></small></h3><form action="/wp-comments-post.php" method="post" id="commentform" class="comment-form"><p class="comment-notes"><span id="email-notes">Your email address will not be published.</span> <span class="required-field-message">Required fields are marked <span class="required">*</span></span></p><p class="comment-form-comment comment-form-float-label"><textarea id="comment" name="comment" placeholder="Leave a comment..." cols="45" rows="8" maxlength="655